  [1mThe consequence:[0m [38;5;153mmigrations/003_drop_notes.sql[39m runs against production on the next deploy and permanently deletes the
  [38;5;153mnotes[39m values for all 48,000 rows in [38;5;153musers[39m. There is no rollback: [38;5;153mALTER TABLE users DROP COLUMN notes[39m discards the
  data, and a down-migration can only recreate an empty column. Anything still reading [38;5;153musers.notes[39m — an app query, a
  report, an export — breaks at that moment.

