  1. [1mSQLite version.[0m [38;5;153mDROP COLUMN[39m needs SQLite 3.35+. Older versions require the 12-step table-rebuild dance. If the
     deploy job's SQLite is older, this is not a one-liner.
  2. [1mArchiving first.[0m A common middle path is a migration that copies [38;5;153mid, notes[39m into a [38;5;153musers_notes_archive[39m table before
